</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>System Behavior &amp; Validation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>HTML Editor</strong>: Admin must enter content using the HTML ed=
itor. The system should ensure the content is valid HTML.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Import Site</strong>: Admin can import a site URL, and the syste=
m will fetch and display the site for editing.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Capture Data</strong>: The system should capture any data entere=
d by the user if the <strong>Capture Submitted Data</strong> option is enab=
led.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Security Handling</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Data Integrity</strong>: All custom landing page content must be=
 securely saved and accessible only by authorized personnel.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Preview Security</strong>: The preview must accurately reflect t=
he final landing page content.</p></li>
<li>
